    "text": "The Battle Box came in the Pokémon League kits that Play! Pokémon stores received from April 2026: a draft kit for two players with one copy of each card, which players draft into 40-card decks and return to the box afterwards. The copies here are non-holo cards from Temporal Forces, Twilight Masquerade and Stellar Crown.",
